  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kigali Implementation Plan to phase down HFC in C&#xf4;te d&apos;Ivoire</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparation of a HFC phase-down management plan (Kigali Implementation Plan KIP) for C&#xf4;te d`Ivoire to meet its obligations under the Kigali Amendment KA.  The KIP will include provision for national strategy development, assistance for the implementation of HFC import licensing and quota system, survey, data collection and analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
